  "content": {
    "id": "p7-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Solve the following equations for $\\theta\\in[0,2\\pi]$:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin 2\\theta=\\cos\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6},\\dfrac{\\pi}{2},\\dfrac{5\\pi}{6},\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}$.\n\nUse $\\sin2\\theta=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta$ and factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta&=\\cos\\theta\\\\2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta-\\cos\\theta&=0\\\\\\cos\\theta(2\\sin\\theta-1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\nThus $\\cos\\theta=0$ or $\\sin\\theta=\\tfrac12$.\n$$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{5\\pi}{6},\\frac{3\\pi}{2}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 49
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos 2\\theta=\\sin\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6},\\dfrac{5\\pi}{6},\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}$.\n\nUse $\\cos2\\theta=1-2\\sin^2\\theta$ and factor the quadratic.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}1-2\\sin^2\\theta&=\\sin\\theta\\\\2\\sin^2\\theta+\\sin\\theta-1&=0\\\\(2\\sin\\theta-1)(\\sin\\theta+1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\nThus $\\sin\\theta=\\tfrac12$ or $\\sin\\theta=-1$.\n$$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\frac{5\\pi}{6},\\frac{3\\pi}{2}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 57
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q8-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\sin 2\\theta=\\tan\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{4},\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4},\\pi,\\dfrac{5\\pi}{4},\\dfrac{7\\pi}{4},2\\pi$.\n\nWrite tangent as sine over cosine, then factor; retain both endpoints.",
          "worked": "Tangent is defined only when $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta&=\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}\\\\2\\sin\\theta\\cos^2\\theta&=\\sin\\theta\\\\\\sin\\theta(2\\cos^2\\theta-1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\nThus $\\sin\\theta=0$ or $\\cos^2\\theta=\\tfrac12$.\nFor $\\sin\\theta=0$, $\\theta=0,\\pi,2\\pi$.\nFor $\\cos\\theta=\\pm\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$, $\\theta=\\tfrac\\pi4,\\tfrac{3\\pi}4,\\tfrac{5\\pi}4,\\tfrac{7\\pi}4$.\nAll have $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.\n$$\\theta=0,\\frac\\pi4,\\frac{3\\pi}4,\\pi,\\frac{5\\pi}4,\\frac{7\\pi}4,2\\pi.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 73
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q8-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\tan 2\\theta=\\cot\\theta$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta=\\dfrac\\pi6,\\dfrac\\pi2,\\dfrac{5\\pi}6,\\dfrac{7\\pi}6,\\dfrac{3\\pi}2,\\dfrac{11\\pi}6$.\n\nExpress both sides as quotients and use double-angle identities.",
          "worked": "The equation requires $\\cos2\\theta\\ne0$ and $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\sin2\\theta}{\\cos2\\theta}&=\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\sin2\\theta\\sin\\theta&=\\cos2\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\2\\sin^2\\theta\\cos\\theta&=(1-2\\sin^2\\theta)\\cos\\theta\\\\\\cos\\theta(4\\sin^2\\theta-1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\nThus $\\cos\\theta=0$ or $\\sin\\theta=\\pm\\tfrac12$.\nFor $\\cos\\theta=0$, $\\theta=\\tfrac\\pi2,\\tfrac{3\\pi}2$.\nFor $\\sin\\theta=\\pm\\tfrac12$, $\\theta=\\tfrac\\pi6,\\tfrac{5\\pi}6,\\tfrac{7\\pi}6,\\tfrac{11\\pi}6$.\nAll satisfy the domain restrictions.\n$$\\theta=\\frac\\pi6,\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{5\\pi}6,\\frac{7\\pi}6,\\frac{3\\pi}2,\\frac{11\\pi}6.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 81
      }
    ]
  },
